# File Size Limit

- **Maximum 600 lines per source file** (`.ts`, `.tsx`, `.js`, `.jsx`).
- If a file approaches or exceeds 600 lines, split it before adding more code.
- Prefer extraction by responsibility:
  - constants and types → dedicated modules
  - pure helpers → `utils/`
  - state and side effects → custom hooks (`hooks/`)
  - UI sections → focused components
- The entry component should compose smaller pieces; avoid monolithic containers.
- When refactoring, delete dead code instead of keeping legacy helpers "just in case".
